Jer 27:1 , Under the type of bonds and yokes he prophesies the subduing of the neighbour kings unto Nebuchadnezzar;
Jer 27:8 , He exhorts them to yield, and not to believe the false prophets;
Jer 27:12 , The like he does to Zedekiah;
Jer 27:19 , He foretells the remnant of the vessels shall be carried to Babylon, and there continue until the day of visitation.
